  'Push needs HTTPS (or localhost on the office’s own PC). Open the office through an HTTPS address such as Tailscale Serve: see': 'Le notifiche push richiedono HTTPS (o localhost sul PC dell’ufficio). Apri l’ufficio tramite un indirizzo HTTPS, ad esempio Tailscale Serve: vedi',
